exports[`follow-up templates > live + operator templates (golden) 1`] = `
"Hi Jane,

🎉 You're live! Setup is done: missed callers get a text back in seconds, and website leads land in your inbox.

Every new lead shows up in CrankLeads: https://app.crankleads.test

No more setup reminders from us. Questions? Just reply to this email.

— The CrankLeads team"
`;

exports[`follow-up templates > live + operator templates (golden) 2`] = `
"CrankLeads buyer stuck: Jane's Roofing (Close) — 1 step left after 10 business days

They got the day-1/3/5/10 reminders (email + text) and still haven't finished setup. A personal call usually fixes it.

Owner: Jane Roofer <jane@roofco.example> (705) 555-0101
Organization: org-1
Provisioned: 2026-10-02T19:00:00Z

Setup checklist:
  [x] Add your prices
  [ ] Turn on call forwarding

Ops: https://app.crankleads.test/internal/ops"
`;

exports[`follow-up templates > reminder email (golden) 1`] = `
"Hi Jane,

Quick nudge: your system isn't catching leads yet because setup isn't finished.

2 steps left:
  1. Set call forwarding (dial **004*+17055550000# from your business phone)
  2. Add your website form and send a test lead

Do the next one now (one click): https://app.crankleads.test/onboarding?step=phone&org=org-1

Questions? Just reply to this email.

— The CrankLeads team

Don't want these setup reminders? Stop them: https://app.crankleads.test/api/public/crankleads/setup-reminders?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
`;

exports[`follow-up templates > reminder email (golden) 2`] = `
